    },
    {
      "id": "26d24eb1ed5480eca7d2ed9ad0788cc4",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Track which participants have acknowledged",
      "text": "Track which participants have acknowledged"
    },
    {
      "id": "26d24eb1ed54805882c2ecda4db89a1f",
      "type": "sub_sub_header",
      "html": "Step 2.2: Participant Execution",
      "text": "Step 2.2: Participant Execution"
    },
    {
      "id": "26d24eb1ed548005aba1ed9123ac4d2f",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "<span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"0\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">On Receiving COMMIT:</span>",
      "text": "On Receiving COMMIT:"
    },
    {
      "id": "26d24eb1ed54808fbfe0d27c2d314146",
      "type": "numbered_list",
      "html": "<span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"0\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">Apply Changes</span>: Make all prepared changes permanent",
      "text": "Apply Changes: Make all prepared changes permanent"
    },
    {
      "id": "26d24eb1ed548020b03be9b16e69e1bb",
      "type": "numbered_list",
      "html": "<span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"0\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">Release Locks</span>: Free all acquired resources",
      "text": "Release Locks: Free all acquired resources"
    },
    {
      "id": "26d24eb1ed54801682eaf83a8ddd06ad",
      "type": "numbered_list",
      "html": "<span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"0\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">Log Commit</span>: Write commit record to local log",
      "text": "Log Commit: Write commit record to local log"
    },
    {
      "id": "26d24eb1ed5480c09d51e986b9d95079",
      "type": "numbered_list",
      "html": "<span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"0\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">Send ACK</span>: <div class=\"notion-inline-code-container\" style=\"display:inline\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;SFMono-Regular&quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &quot;PT Mono&quot;, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, Courier, monospace;line-height:normal;background:var(--ca-bacIntTra);color:var(--c-redTexSec);border-radius:4px;font-size:85%;padding:0.2em 0.4em;position:relative;bottom:0.065em\" data-token-index=\"2\" spellcheck=\"false\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">Participant → Coordinator: ACK_COMMIT(transaction_id)</span></div>",
      "text": "Send ACK: Participant → Coordinator: ACK_COMMIT(transaction_id)"
    },
    {
      "id": "26d24eb1ed548048954dcdecf8f2d57a",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "<span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"0\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">On Receiving ABORT:</span>",
      "text": "On Receiving ABORT:"
    },
    {
      "id": "26d24eb1ed5480e5b3f4f1c58eaafe7a",
      "type": "numbered_list",
      "html": "<span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"0\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">Rollback Changes</span>: Discard all prepared changes",
      "text": "Rollback Changes: Discard all prepared changes"
    },
    {
      "id": "26d24eb1ed54806b94cee80ce702542b",
      "type": "numbered_list",
      "html": "<span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"0\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">Release Locks</span>: Free all acquired resources",
      "text": "Release Locks: Free all acquired resources"
    },
    {
      "id": "26d24eb1ed5480b18892d92f3c6abe20",
      "type": "numbered_list",
      "html": "<span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"0\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">Log Abort</span>: Write abort record to local log",
      "text": "Log Abort: Write abort record to local log"
    },
    {
      "id": "26d24eb1ed548099b1e8eec7a456cd74",
      "type": "numbered_list",
      "html": "<span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"0\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">Send ACK</span>: <div class=\"notion-inline-code-container\" style=\"display:inline\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;SFMono-Regular&quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &quot;PT Mono&quot;, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, Courier, monospace;line-height:normal;background:var(--ca-bacIntTra);color:var(--c-redTexSec);border-radius:4px;font-size:85%;padding:0.2em 0.4em;position:relative;bottom:0.065em\" data-token-index=\"2\" spellcheck=\"false\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">Participant → Coordinator: ACK_ABORT(transaction_id)</span></div>",
      "text": "Send ACK: Participant → Coordinator: ACK_ABORT(transaction_id)"
    },
    {
      "id": "26d24eb1ed5480d0b21be9ebb06d0fd1",
      "type": "sub_sub_header",
      "html": "Step 2.3: Coordinator Finalization",
      "text": "Step 2.3: Coordinator Finalization"
    },
    {
      "id": "26d24eb1ed5480e1b67fd334f26cf19d",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Wait for ACKs from all participants",
      "text": "Wait for ACKs from all participants"
    },
    {
      "id": "26d24eb1ed5480bebe3add52bbe1c775",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Log transaction completion",
      "text": "Log transaction completion"
    },
    {
      "id": "26d24eb1ed5480889f50f64665d3e233",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Clean up transaction state",
      "text": "Clean up transaction state"
    },
    {
      "id": "26d24eb1ed5480b99e32e7db01aab285",
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "id": "26d24eb1ed5480dfabf4cec84a0d7530",
      "type": "header",
      "html": "What if Coordinator Crashes?",
      "text": "What if Coordinator Crashes?"
    },
    {
      "id": "26d24eb1ed548095a5c9c5d079119f7e",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "The system doesn't fail entirely, but it can become partially blocked or inconsistent depending on WHEN the coordinator fails.",
      "text": "The system doesn't fail entirely, but it can become partially blocked or inconsistent depending on WHEN the coordinator fails."
    },
    {
      "id": "26f24eb1ed5480318103c16b585512d2",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Intuitively it can be found if what can go wrong in cases if the coordinator crashed.",
      "text": "Intuitively it can be found if what can go wrong in cases if the coordinator crashed."
    },
    {
      "id": "26d24eb1ed54802aa4a4e61313cc55f5",
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "id": "26d24eb1ed548048a93bc469371e145d",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "There are a lot more What Ifs? Most of them can be answered easily and the system can be kept consistent provided the assumptions are correct that:",
      "text": "There are a lot more What Ifs? Most of them can be answered easily and the system can be kept consistent provided the assumptions are correct that:"
    },
    {
      "id": "26d24eb1ed548073a9a3e8b58b62023a",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Network partition is temporary.",
      "text": "Network partition is temporary."
    },
    {
      "id": "26d24eb1ed548071877ae29c3024f51c",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Failed nodes eventually recover.",
      "text": "Failed nodes eventually recover."
    },
    {
      "id": "26d24eb1ed54801c963be16635278be2",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Messages are eventually sent.",
      "text": "Messages are eventually sent."
    },
    {
      "id": "26d24eb1ed5480a780bbc96bbec6336e",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "id": "26d24eb1ed548028b354c4cc42c24920",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "id": "26d24eb1ed548047b1e1d8f415bca263",
      "type": "text"
    }
  ]
